# LongCat-2.5-Preview — findings by Mimo v2.6 Flash (EXCLUDED — no verified benchmarks)

- Source: Meituan/`longcat-2.5-preview`
- Date: 2026-09-27 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

> **Self-exclusion:** zero verified public benchmark numbers were found for this exact model/ID. Every normalized score would be a guess, so this file is saved as `.excluded` and `pnpm sync` skips it. No scores below are used in averages.

## Model card

- **Name:** LongCat-2.5-Preview
- **Short description:** Meituan's preview-generation LongCat MoE model (2026-09-25), positioned for long-horizon agentic tasks across terminal, browser, desktop, spreadsheet and design tools; the headline change vs LongCat-2.0 is native image understanding. Sells on price and 1M context, not on published evidence.
- **Provider / access:** LongCat API Platform (`longcat.chat` / `longcat.ai`) — OpenAI-compatible **and** Anthropic-compatible endpoints, plus LongCat Chat web UI. Also served through OpenCode Zen as `longcat-2.5-preview-free` (Chat Completions, `https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/chat/completions`). Not on any open-weights host.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-25 (vendor changelog entry "Version: 2026-09-25 — LongCat-2.5-Preview Now Available"); successor to LongCat-2.0 (2026-06-30). Knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `meituan/longcat-2.5-preview`; OpenCode free ID `opencode/longcat-2.5-preview-free`. **Free on OpenCode for an unstated "limited time"** — unlimited requests, zero data retention (0 days, not used for training) per OpenCode's Zen privacy table; no expiry date published anywhere (a "two-week trial" figure circulating in aggregator posts is not an official number).
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 / 1,048,576 tokens input; max output 128K (131,072 in the models.dev catalogue entry). Verified from models.dev metadata and Meituan's API pricing/quick-start pages — **no long-context retrieval measurement published**.
- **Modalities:** text + **image in** (new in 2.5; models.dev `attachment: true`); text out; reasoning **yes** (toggle, trace returned in an interleaved `reasoning_content` field); tool calling yes; OpenAI/Anthropic wire formats. No audio/video input claimed; no JSON-mode guarantee documented in the sources found.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-27):** LongCat platform pay-as-you-go **$0.30 / 1M uncached input, $0.006 / 1M cached input, $1.20 / 1M output** — the page itself flags this as a **limited-time discounted** rate (¥2 / ¥0.04 / ¥8 equivalents). Through OpenCode: **$0 across input, output and cached read**, monthly limit "Unlimited", labelled "free for a limited time" with **no published end date**. Zero-retention on the OpenCode route.
- **Architecture:** ~1.6T total parameters, ~48B active per token, sparse MoE — figures reported from Meituan site metadata and Chinese trade coverage of the 25 September listing, **not** from a vendor parameter table. No technical report, model card, licence or parameter table published. OpenCode's catalogue records the weights as **closed**; unlike LongCat-2.0 (MIT, on Hugging Face), 2.5 has **no released weights** and no announced release date.

