### Explicitly NOT attributable to this model

The following often appear next to the LongCat name and must not be copied in — they belong to **LongCat-2.0**, a different (open-weight, June 2026) checkpoint:

- Terminal-Bench 2.1 70.8%, SWE-bench Pro 59.5%, SWE-bench Multilingual 77.3%, FORTE 73.2, BrowseComp 79.9, IFEval 90.0, GPQA-diamond 88.9 (Hugging Face `meituan-longcat/LongCat-2.0` model card, in-house harness)
- Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 19, AA-Briefcase 735/740, GDPval-AA 856, AutomationBench-AA 5%, Terminal-Bench 4.0 0%, SciCode 36%, HLE 34%, AA-LCR v1.1 65% (AA LongCat 2.0 comparison pages)
- Comparison-table figures such as "AA Coding 68.8 / AA Intelligence 29.7 / GPQA 94.1%" that sit in OrcaRouter's 2.5 vs Gemini 3.1 Pro article belong to the **Gemini 3.1 Pro** column, not to LongCat.

Vendor-side status check: Meituan's launch post and 2026-09-25 changelog contain **no benchmark table** for 2.5; no Hugging Face repo in `meituan-longcat` covers it; no technical report or model card exists; no leaderboard entry; no third-party evaluation as of 2026-09-27 (Eyestech 2026-09-26, OrcaRouter 2026-09-26/27, drweb 2026-09-26, note.com 2026-09-26, Cocoloop 2026-09-27).

